  "description": "Runs an ASP.NET Core app (for example Blazor Server) as a local tool in the user's own browser, without WebView2: it listens on the loopback address only, admits only the browser it opened (a launch token exchanged for a cookie), checks the Host header, and on Windows opens the browser without elevation even when the app runs as administrator.",
